WEBVTT

00:01.010 --> 00:03.910
<i>At the ends of the earth, 
blanketed by miasma,</i>

00:03.910 --> 00:07.980
<i>lay a land home to monstrous vassals 
who once dominated and devoured mankind.</i>

00:07.980 --> 00:10.560
<i>Over them reigned a mighty king,</i>

00:10.560 --> 00:13.980
<i>who forbade all humans entry.</i>

00:14.610 --> 00:16.740
Your Majesty, please!

00:16.740 --> 00:18.950
We beg you to reconsider!

00:18.950 --> 00:21.400
Enough. I've made my decision.

00:21.400 --> 00:27.500
B-But this is all far too irregular, 
even for a royal whim.

00:27.500 --> 00:31.530
A queen ought to descend 
from a royal or noble lineage.

00:31.530 --> 00:34.730
And a <i>human</i> girl is simply out—

00:37.040 --> 00:38.800
I am king,

00:38.800 --> 00:41.560
and I will brook no argument.

00:51.850 --> 00:53.760
In that case, sire,

00:54.840 --> 00:57.030
would you at least consider...

02:30.000 --> 02:35.000
Carpenter Bees and a Court Banquet

02:35.190 --> 02:37.460
Sari!

02:37.460 --> 02:39.160
Cy, Clops.

02:39.410 --> 02:42.260
You mustn't roam the palace on your own!

02:42.260 --> 02:44.600
His Majesty will reprimand us!

02:44.600 --> 02:46.350
The king is scary! Scary!

02:46.640 --> 02:48.910
I'm sorry, but...

02:49.790 --> 02:53.240
<i>I came here as a sacrifice to the king.</i>

02:53.240 --> 02:57.250
<i>Really, he should already 
have eaten me by now.</i>

02:57.660 --> 02:58.720
<i>And yet...</i>

02:59.180 --> 03:03.410
Though I was born a beast, 
half my blood is human.

03:03.810 --> 03:05.730
I can never truly be either.

03:06.380 --> 03:10.690
How could such a pitiful weakling be a king?

03:12.080 --> 03:13.840
You're not weak.

03:15.350 --> 03:20.260
<i>The king has been hurting himself 
to spare the sacrifices all this time.</i>

03:20.640 --> 03:24.510
<i>And he said he would keep me at his side,</i>

03:24.970 --> 03:29.190
<i>even though I was raised to be sacrificed 
and have no home to go back to.</i>

03:29.940 --> 03:32.550
<i>He's so strong and kind.</i>

03:33.090 --> 03:39.640
<i>He only makes himself look scary to stop 
rebellions and pointless fighting.</i>

03:40.260 --> 03:43.080
<i>He's really trying to protect everyone.</i>

03:44.120 --> 03:50.540
<i>I can't sit still while he argues about me 
with important people every day!</i>

03:51.140 --> 03:53.490
What are you doing here, Sariphi?

03:53.490 --> 03:56.010
Y-Y-Your Majesty!

03:56.470 --> 04:00.740
Cy, Clops, can't you even 
stand guard properly?

04:00.740 --> 04:05.410
Wait, Leonhart! I left on my own. 
Don't be cross with them.

04:05.760 --> 04:06.850
"Leo"...?

04:09.050 --> 04:10.890
In any case, return to your chambers.

04:11.400 --> 04:13.690
Anubis, I must bid you a moment's leave.

04:14.460 --> 04:15.180
Sire.

04:19.090 --> 04:23.150
I told you to wait quietly 
here while I was gone.

04:23.460 --> 04:25.580
If you need something, 
I'll have it brought to you.

04:25.800 --> 04:27.290
I know.

04:27.290 --> 04:31.030
But I want to do something—
anything—to help you, Leo.

04:33.050 --> 04:36.190
I will soon hold a court banquet.

04:36.750 --> 04:42.940
Royalty and nobility from throughout my 
realm and its vassal states will attend.

04:43.380 --> 04:46.040
As will you.

04:46.040 --> 04:49.840
From the whole realm... You want 
me at such an important event?

04:50.190 --> 04:53.180
The dotards in the senate proposed it.

04:53.180 --> 04:57.300
They seem to think that if I 
present you to the peerage,

04:57.300 --> 05:00.730
the resulting backlash will change my mind.

05:01.020 --> 05:04.020
How should I behave?

05:04.020 --> 05:07.240
Don't dwell on it. Hold your head high.

05:07.590 --> 05:08.440
However,

05:08.800 --> 05:14.000
never call me "Leonhart" at the banquet 
or in company from now on.

05:14.000 --> 05:15.560
It sets a bad example.

05:16.090 --> 05:18.080
Call me "sire," as you have been.

05:18.810 --> 05:20.330
Fine.

05:26.660 --> 05:29.720
I wonder if there's anything I can do.

05:36.380 --> 05:38.560
May you sleep well, sire.

05:59.460 --> 06:02.060
Don't shout in my ear.

06:02.060 --> 06:04.500
Beasts have far more 
sensitive hearing than hu—

06:04.500 --> 06:09.060
Sorry, Your Majesty! How could I fall 
asleep while you're still working?!

06:09.480 --> 06:11.350
Never mind. But what is this?

06:12.250 --> 06:13.750
Where did you get flowers?

06:14.090 --> 06:17.330
I made them. They're artificial.

06:17.330 --> 06:20.780
The real flowers I picked 
before wilted in no time.

06:23.020 --> 06:25.440
These will stay pretty forever,

06:25.440 --> 06:29.070
so I hope they'll help you relax 
whenever you return to your chambers.

06:29.570 --> 06:32.390
I know it's not much, but it's all I can do.

06:33.450 --> 06:34.950
<b>F{*\frz10}A{*\frz0}N{*\frz-10}CY</b>

06:33.450 --> 06:34.950
<b>F{*\frz10}A{*\frz0}N{*\frz-10}CY</b>

06:33.680 --> 06:36.230
Look! I dressed up your bed, too!

06:36.230 --> 06:39.660
I thought I told you I take 
no interest in such things.

06:41.050 --> 06:46.560
Still, perhaps false flowers suit me.

06:47.760 --> 06:52.850
I, too, am a sham—a beast with 
human blood and a human form.

06:53.310 --> 06:58.780
A false king who hides his 
timid heart behind a snarl.

06:59.280 --> 07:02.660
These flowers are practically my double.

07:03.360 --> 07:05.050
That's not true.

07:05.440 --> 07:07.480
They may be artificial,

07:07.910 --> 07:12.950
but if they can touch someone's heart, 
I think they're as good as the real thing.

07:15.180 --> 07:21.090
Oh, but you're less like flowers and 
more like the bees that land on them.

07:21.090 --> 07:22.120
Bees?

07:22.630 --> 07:26.600
Carpenter bees are big, 
and they make a loud buzz,

07:26.600 --> 07:28.870
so they seem scary at first glance.

07:29.580 --> 07:32.610
Watch out, Sariphi! A bee!

07:33.060 --> 07:38.360
But they're really gentle and work hard 
flying around for their friends.

07:38.840 --> 07:41.810
And they're also big and fluffy, just like you.

07:42.300 --> 07:47.010
But those creatures must 
merely obey their instincts.

07:47.390 --> 07:49.110
That's true.

07:49.690 --> 07:53.460
But since I had no choice 
about being a sacrifice...

07:54.230 --> 07:57.060
Come on. The nectar's this way.

07:58.430 --> 08:04.160
...their dedication to their role 
seemed beautiful to me.

08:05.210 --> 08:08.910
So you're not a fake, sire.

08:09.740 --> 08:16.270
I hope that one day, I'll have 
a purpose like that, too.

08:33.820 --> 08:35.440
Wow!

08:35.440 --> 08:37.480
Look at all the people!

08:37.480 --> 08:40.670
His Majesty isn't fond of 
having guests in the castle,

08:40.670 --> 08:43.570
so we haven't seen it this busy in ages.

08:43.570 --> 08:44.320
Ages.

08:44.320 --> 08:45.850
This is amazing!

08:45.850 --> 08:50.670
I never knew there were so many 
different kinds of beasts.

08:50.670 --> 08:52.160
Human girl.

08:52.720 --> 08:53.980
Mr. Chancellor.

08:53.980 --> 08:57.750
Be on your best behavior 
today. Is that clear?

08:57.750 --> 09:01.950
Don't wander. Keep your mouth shut. 
In fact, don't do anything.

09:02.180 --> 09:05.800
Huh? But I wanted to entertain the guests.

09:05.800 --> 09:08.160
And I thought so hard 
about how to greet them.

09:08.160 --> 09:09.900
Don't give yourself airs!

09:10.510 --> 09:15.220
You are merely a sacrifice, 
kept alive by His Majesty's whim.

09:15.660 --> 09:17.870
The peerage is certain to object.

09:18.160 --> 09:23.630
Even I categorically refuse to 
accept you as my king's consort.

09:23.630 --> 09:27.680
But since you are to stand 
beside him at this banquet,

09:27.680 --> 09:31.170
I will not permit you to sully his 
royal dignity with your conduct.

09:31.170 --> 09:35.720
Merely keeping company with a human is 
already a great hindrance to His Majesty.

09:35.720 --> 09:38.960
Never let that fact slip your mind.

09:40.590 --> 09:45.010
I haven't been invited to the 
palace in ages. Have you?

09:45.010 --> 09:48.580
I hear His Majesty will be 
presenting his new queen.

09:48.580 --> 09:51.520
I can only imagine how 
magnificent her fur must be.

09:51.770 --> 09:58.020
He's always rebuffed our kingdom's 
proposals. How fine can this girl be?

09:58.020 --> 10:00.130
We'll have to see for ourselves.

10:00.130 --> 10:01.560
Good heavens.

10:01.560 --> 10:06.680
The king would never take a bride 
from a backwater Reptilian kingdom.

10:06.680 --> 10:08.420
Certainly not.

10:08.420 --> 10:13.010
Such dismissive treatment is just 
what you Reptilians deserve.

10:13.010 --> 10:14.010
You dare?!

10:14.360 --> 10:17.420
My lords and ladies, 
His Majesty has arrived.

10:17.420 --> 10:19.220
Pray be silent.

10:25.450 --> 10:28.170
His Majesty's coat is always beautiful.

10:28.170 --> 10:30.550
And what magnificent horns he has.

10:31.100 --> 10:34.110
Then, the girl beside him must be...

10:35.860 --> 10:38.060
H-Human!

10:40.800 --> 10:41.770
A human?!

10:41.770 --> 10:44.300
Surely <i>she</i> can't be the future queen?!

10:44.300 --> 10:46.000
A human?! Preposterous!

10:46.270 --> 10:50.060
I can't believe it! Her face is flat! 
Her limbs are like twigs!

10:50.060 --> 10:52.990
And her skin is as bald as a Reptilian's!

10:52.990 --> 10:54.580
How unsightly!

10:53.220 --> 10:56.960
M-Mind your tongue! How dare 
you compare us to humans?!

10:56.960 --> 11:00.600
Your Majesty, what is the meaning 
of this?! I demand an explanation!

11:00.600 --> 11:02.050
Silence!

11:09.170 --> 11:10.260
<i>Sire...</i>

11:15.910 --> 11:17.120
It's fine.

11:19.520 --> 11:24.330
<i>I knew this would happen. 
I've always been a fake.</i>

11:24.990 --> 11:26.270
<i>But at the very least,</i>

11:26.270 --> 11:29.840
<i>I need to hold my head 
high like he told me to.</i>

11:30.340 --> 11:34.420
<i>I'm standing next to the 
lord of this kingdom!</i>

11:34.760 --> 11:39.960
Now, my lords and ladies, please enjoy 
yourselves at this evening's banquet.

11:48.880 --> 11:50.960
<i>This is so awkward.</i>

11:51.860 --> 11:56.410
<i>Isn't there anything 
I can do to help the king?</i>

12:02.050 --> 12:04.230
No! Don't rise without—

12:11.620 --> 12:15.360
Oh, how dreadful. That wretched 
human wasted no time.

12:15.360 --> 12:19.060
We can hardly touch that dish now, can we?

12:19.060 --> 12:20.000
This is for you.

12:23.510 --> 12:28.570
The king arranged this feast for 
tonight's banquet—for all of you.

12:28.930 --> 12:31.050
Please, eat your fill.

12:33.080 --> 12:34.370
Here, help yourselves.

12:49.500 --> 12:50.750
How do you find it?

12:51.590 --> 12:54.540
Most... delicious.

12:54.980 --> 12:56.820
Thank goodness!

13:03.910 --> 13:05.860
We'll help, too!

13:05.860 --> 13:07.560
Help! Help!

13:07.960 --> 13:10.070
My, this is delectable.

13:10.070 --> 13:12.380
Truly, food fit for a king.

13:12.380 --> 13:14.730
And all in our honor.

13:14.990 --> 13:16.250
To His Majesty!

13:16.250 --> 13:18.200
Cheers!

13:20.810 --> 13:23.760
Oh, that wayward girl...

13:23.760 --> 13:24.800
Never mind.

13:24.800 --> 13:29.560
B-But, sire, after all my orders to stay put...

13:29.560 --> 13:30.610
Yes.

13:30.610 --> 13:35.700
She refuses to be governed 
by me, let alone you.

13:38.470 --> 13:40.440
Oh, I'll help you with that.

13:41.560 --> 13:43.680
I couldn't possibly presume.

13:44.900 --> 13:47.560
There's still plenty of food, isn't there?

13:47.560 --> 13:49.110
Where are the kitchens?

13:49.110 --> 13:50.990
Right this way.

13:50.990 --> 13:51.970
Way.

13:55.740 --> 14:00.910
You think you can barge into 
<i>my</i> kitchen, human girl?

14:00.910 --> 14:03.240
Y-You see...

14:03.490 --> 14:07.180
Go away! The palace kitchens 
are sacred ground!

14:07.180 --> 14:08.970
If a human comes in here...

14:08.970 --> 14:11.870
You'll spoil the dishes we 
worked so hard to make!

14:11.870 --> 14:15.040
Sari is the future queen!

14:15.040 --> 14:16.580
Queen! Queen!

14:16.580 --> 14:23.050
Hmm? So <i>you're</i> the one who dumped 
this last-minute banquet on us?

14:23.050 --> 14:27.020
And now you want to carry our cooking?!

14:30.180 --> 14:31.760
Okay. I'll allow it.

14:31.760 --> 14:33.390
What?!

14:33.390 --> 14:35.770
Are you sure, Head Chef Todd?!

14:35.770 --> 14:37.520
What if the king finds out?

14:37.520 --> 14:41.220
She just came from the king, numbskulls!

14:41.220 --> 14:44.590
He must have something in mind.

14:45.640 --> 14:47.500
Hey, what're you standing around for?!

14:47.500 --> 14:50.650
Get carrying! Do you want 
the food to get cold?

14:52.300 --> 14:53.420
Right!

14:58.020 --> 15:00.290
Um... Thank you very much

15:00.590 --> 15:02.990
for letting a human like me into your kitch—

15:02.990 --> 15:05.300
Get going! We're trying to work here!

15:05.300 --> 15:06.750
Y-Yessir!

15:16.130 --> 15:22.350
Damn that filthy human. She won't fool me.

15:23.300 --> 15:26.130
Cy, Clops, what's this?

15:26.130 --> 15:31.100
This rare fruit wine was a gift 
from the mayor of Amernia.

15:31.100 --> 15:35.490
Amernia is a trading city, 
so it gets lots of unusual goods.

15:35.490 --> 15:36.720
Wow.

15:36.720 --> 15:37.700
I know!

15:37.700 --> 15:39.820
I'll bring this to the king!

15:40.210 --> 15:44.560
Wait! His Majesty doesn't 
consume gifts from abroad!

15:45.370 --> 15:49.090
<i><i>Our</i> princess will be crowned queen!</i>

15:49.090 --> 15:52.900
<i>And then my people will be 
thick as thieves with royalty!</i>

15:50.990 --> 15:54.470
Sire, this is a rare wine from—

16:05.230 --> 16:07.680
Oh, sire, I'm so sorry! Are you all right?!

16:09.370 --> 16:13.450
Wh-What impudence! 
And what a graceless girl!

16:13.450 --> 16:16.860
Wretched human! I'd wager 
you did that deliberately!

16:22.910 --> 16:23.770
Huh?

16:31.670 --> 16:35.040
Not a bad vintage. I appreciate it.

16:35.040 --> 16:36.350
Sire...

16:36.350 --> 16:40.660
P-Pardon me, sire. Are you hurt?

16:42.320 --> 16:44.630
What a fine tail you have.

16:45.090 --> 16:49.990
No wonder it gets tangled 
around others' feet.

16:51.250 --> 16:54.440
F-Forgive me, sire! I didn't mean to—

16:54.440 --> 16:58.020
Sariphi is to be my queen.

16:58.020 --> 17:04.750
Discourtesy to her is disloyalty 
to me, your king!

17:20.970 --> 17:27.410
You owe your life to the human girl 
you insulted. Remember that.

17:28.100 --> 17:31.130
But I won't be so lenient again.

17:41.230 --> 17:43.320
Cheer up, Sari.

17:43.320 --> 17:45.560
His Majesty is always angry.

17:45.560 --> 17:47.070
Not your fault.

17:47.070 --> 17:49.550
Thanks, Cy, Clops.

17:50.040 --> 17:53.340
But it doesn't change what happened.

17:54.250 --> 17:56.950
...a great hindrance to His Majesty.

17:59.360 --> 18:03.460
I'm on course to prove the chancellor right.

18:05.390 --> 18:06.080
Huh?

18:06.080 --> 18:07.130
What in the...

18:14.620 --> 18:16.470
Grab hold, Sariphi.

18:16.950 --> 18:18.260
Sire...

18:20.250 --> 18:22.160
Why would you grab me <i>there</i>?

18:22.160 --> 18:23.630
But...

18:23.630 --> 18:26.250
No matter. Just don't let go.

18:28.530 --> 18:30.560
Huh? What?!

18:40.180 --> 18:42.250
What's going on?!

18:42.250 --> 18:45.300
This is my holy beast, Gwiber.

18:46.020 --> 18:47.690
A holy beast?

18:49.310 --> 18:51.360
Wow! We're so high up!

18:54.120 --> 18:56.200
You're not afraid of heights?

18:56.200 --> 18:57.360
I love them!

18:57.620 --> 18:59.360
That's convenient.

18:59.840 --> 19:03.330
The gusty upper airs should 
blow away your gloom.

19:05.690 --> 19:07.380
Thank you, sire.

19:08.990 --> 19:13.010
For a moment, I thought 
you would get rid of me.

19:13.010 --> 19:13.830
What?

19:14.100 --> 19:18.770
I mean, no one wants a human queen.

19:19.420 --> 19:23.350
And today went just like the 
senators hoped it would.

19:24.940 --> 19:30.530
And if I'm just a burden to you, 
I'd rather you did get rid of me.

19:43.180 --> 19:44.230
Sire?

19:45.880 --> 19:46.830
You...

19:47.100 --> 19:48.150
little fool!

19:47.580 --> 19:48.620
<b>SQUISH</b>

19:47.580 --> 19:48.620
<b>SQUISH</b>

19:49.240 --> 19:50.550
Have you forgotten?

19:51.260 --> 19:53.650
I've already devoured you once.

19:54.060 --> 19:57.500
Did I not say that you're a part of me now?

19:58.780 --> 20:03.590
Who would hack off his own hand 
or foot because it got in his way?

20:03.590 --> 20:05.730
But at the banquet,

20:07.540 --> 20:11.100
you almost killed that beast 
in front of everyone.

20:11.720 --> 20:15.830
You don't really want to hurt 
your people like that, do you?

20:16.530 --> 20:18.650
If you keep me with you,

20:19.510 --> 20:22.230
you'll have to do something like that again.

20:24.860 --> 20:29.220
When that time comes, you'll stop me again.

20:32.880 --> 20:34.660
Behold, Sariphi.

20:35.080 --> 20:37.540
I am king of this realm.

20:37.540 --> 20:41.820
I have a duty to defend the 
land and lead my brethren.

20:42.500 --> 20:46.970
For a false king such as I, 
no burden could be heavier.

20:47.540 --> 20:50.560
But when I'm with you, and only then,

20:50.560 --> 20:53.350
I am freed from the shackles of kingship.

20:54.160 --> 20:59.180
I feel as though I could forget my duty 
when you merely call my name.

20:59.990 --> 21:02.080
I've never felt this way before.

21:02.800 --> 21:06.670
And only with you can I someday become

21:06.670 --> 21:09.870
a truly mighty king.

21:12.720 --> 21:16.800
Stay by my side. That is your role.

21:18.310 --> 21:19.550
Sire...

21:20.690 --> 21:24.250
Now is the time to call me 
by the name you gave to me.

21:25.010 --> 21:25.800
All right.

21:26.360 --> 21:29.350
Leo. Leonhart.

21:32.250 --> 21:33.060
<i>That's right.</i>

21:34.000 --> 21:39.020
<i>That's what I can do now. 
My reason to go on living.</i>

21:40.130 --> 21:44.310
<i>I'll give sweet nectar to a big bee 
flying through the fields.</i>

21:45.890 --> 21:46.950
<i>One day,</i>

21:48.490 --> 21:50.400
<i>I'll be a real flower.</i>

23:25.360 --> 23:27.350
Curse you, human wench!

23:27.350 --> 23:29.090
How dare you act out at the banquet?

23:29.090 --> 23:31.730
I shall soon expose your vile—

23:32.100 --> 23:33.890
Wait, where did she go?

23:33.890 --> 23:36.340
To Karanbul City, sir. With His Majesty.

23:36.340 --> 23:37.540
Date! Date!

23:37.020 --> 23:40.010
Next Episode

23:37.020 --> 23:40.010
Beasts and a Human Town

23:37.540 --> 23:39.660
Wh-What?!
